copies constitute part of the BOGUS documentation and must be distributed
unchanged with the distribution.

Since we feel the "Notes" files are the heart of the BOGUS distribution, we
have placed them under copyright and are restricting their distribution:

1) You may distribute the "Notes" files via anonymous ftp or via public BBS
